          <p id="guided-rehearsal-summary" class="muted">Studio will choose representative actions for the current quest and verify the selected path.</p>
          <div id="rehearsal-path-note" class="path-note" hidden></div>
          <div class="button-row guided-actions"><button id="run-scenario" class="gold">Run guided rehearsal</button><button id="reset-rehearsal" class="quiet">Start over</button><button id="rehearse-next" class="quiet push-right">Continue to Play <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></button></div>
          <details class="manual-rehearsal"><summary>More rehearsal options</summary><label>Prepared scenario<select id="scenario"></select></label><button id="run-prepared-scenario" class="quiet wide-button">Run selected scenario</button><h3>Try individual player actions</h3><div id="event-tray" class="event-tray"></div><div class="manual-event"><select id="manual-event" aria-label="Player action"></select><input id="manual-target" aria-label="Event target" placeholder="Optional target"><select id="manual-role" aria-label="Actor"><option value="">Local player</option><option value="peer">Peer</option><option value="listen_host">Listen host</option></select><button id="fire-event">Try event</button></div><div class="advance"><input id="advance-seconds" aria-label="Seconds to advance" type="number" min="0" max="86400" value="5"><button id="advance-time" class="quiet">Advance time</button></div></details>
        </section>
        <section id="rehearsal-result" class="result-card empty">Choose a quest and run the rehearsal.</section>
        <p class="proof-line">Browser rehearsal previews quest logic and effects only &mdash; it does not prove behavior in a live game. In-game Runtime receipts prove the adapters.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="stage-play" class="journey-stage" data-stage-panel="play" hidden>
      <div class="stage-hero narrow"><div><h2>Play this revision</h2><p>Certification is fail-closed. Studio may place a revision in the private dev channel, but only the Runtime session you armed in game can pull and activate it.</p></div><div class="readiness-summary" aria-label="Readiness"><span>Draft <strong id="draft-readiness">Waiting</strong></span><span>Rehearsal <strong id="preview-readiness">Optional</strong></span><span>Runtime <strong id="runtime-readiness">Checking</strong></span></div></div>
      <div id="publish-diagnostic" class="diagnostic-card" hidden>
        <div class="diag-head"><span class="diag-title">Certification stopped</span><code id="diag-code" class="diag-code"></code></div>
        <p id="diag-message" class="diag-message"></p>
        <p id="diag-count" class="muted"></p>
        <p class="diag-foot">Nothing was published. The previous questpack, if any, is untouched.</p>
        <button id="diag-fix" class="quiet">Open in Author</button>
      </div>
      <div class="publish-layout">
        <section class="checklist-panel panel" aria-label="Publish checklist">
          <div class="checklist-head"><span class="eyebrow">Live trail</span><span id="runtime-phase" class="readiness neutral">Waiting for project</span></div>
          <ol id="publish-checklist" class="publish-checklist">
            <li><span class="step-icon" data-n="1" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="step-copy"><strong>Certify against the shared contract</strong><span>Every beat checked; publishing is fail-closed.</span></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-icon" data-n="2" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="step-copy"><strong>Play this revision</strong><span>Studio transfers disposable dev bytes; published versions stay untouched.</span></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-icon" data-n="3" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="step-copy"><strong>Runtime validates and pulls</strong><span>The session you armed in F9 owns the decision.</span></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-icon" data-n="4" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="step-copy"><strong>Activate exact revision</strong><span>A fresh activation epoch identifies what is running.</span></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-icon" data-n="5" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="step-copy"><strong>Refresh the existing Charm</strong><span>Dev revisions rebind loaded local targets without another CAST.</span></span></li>
            <li><span class="step-icon" data-n="6" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="step-copy"><strong>Play &mdash; beats confirm from receipts</strong><span>Local receipts advance the live trail below.</span></span></li>
          </ol>
        </section>
        <div class="publish-side">
          <div class="upnext big">
            <div class="eyebrow" id="publish-kicker">Next &mdash; in Studio</div>
            <div class="upnext-title"><h3 id="publish-ready-title">Choose a quest</h3><span id="publish-keys" class="keycaps"></span></div>
            <p id="publish-ready-detail" class="muted">A saved draft can be certified and published.</p>
            <div class="status-card"><div class="status-title-row"><h3 id="quest-status-title">No quest chosen</h3><span id="quest-status-version" class="status-version" hidden></span></div><p id="quest-status-state" class="status-state idle">Nothing is playing yet</p></div>
            <p class="active-revision-line"><span>Active in game</span><strong id="active-revision" class="active-revision-value">Nothing active.</strong></p>
            <p id="runtime-next" class="next-step">Publish a quest to begin.</p>
            <div class="publish-actions"><button id="play-project" class="gold" disabled>Play this revision</button><button id="publish-project" class="quiet" disabled>Publish immutable version</button><button id="play-next" class="quiet" disabled>Observe live proof <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></button></div>
            <p class="immutability-note">Playing is disposable and private. Publishing remains an independent immutable release step.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="stage-observe" class="journey-stage" data-stage-panel="observe" hidden>
      <div class="stage-hero narrow"><div><h2>Observe the live telling</h2><p>Stay at creator altitude while the game runs. This view follows the exact active revision, current beat, rejected branches, and terminal proof without asking you to reconstruct the receipt trail.</p></div><div class="readiness-summary" aria-label="Observation"><span>Runtime <strong id="observe-runtime">Checking</strong></span><span>Beat <strong id="observe-beat">Waiting</strong></span></div></div>
      <section class="receipts-panel panel">
        <div class="receipts-head"><span class="eyebrow">Live proof</span><small id="receipt-count">None yet &middot; refreshes automatically</small></div>
        <div id="runtime-receipts" class="receipt-list"><div class="empty">Play a revision to see Validation, Transfer, Activation, Rebind, and Runtime-observed proof.</div></div>
      </section>
      <section class="spatial-evidence-panel panel" aria-label="Steward spatial evidence">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">Round trip</span><h2>Return live proof to the map</h2><p class="muted">Download bounded 3D observations from the newest matching activation and run. Steward imports this JSON into its separate evidence store.</p></div>
        <div><button id="download-spatial-evidence" class="quiet" disabled>Download spatial evidence</button><p id="spatial-evidence-status" class="muted" role="status">Play an imported map sphere to create evidence.</p></div>
      </section>
      <section class="run-control-panel panel" aria-label="Run control">
        <div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Run control</span><h2>Reset and tell it again</h2></div><span id="run-state" class="readiness neutral">Checking</span></div>
        <div class="binding-control"><div><strong>Exact Charm binding</strong><small>Runtime offers only nearby, locally-owned allowlisted targets.</small></div><div class="button-row"><button id="find-bindings" class="quiet">Find candidates</button><select id="binding-candidate" aria-label="Binding candidate" disabled></select><button id="bind-experience" class="gold" disabled>Bind this quest</button><button id="restore-binding" class="quiet" disabled>Restore last binding</button></div><p id="binding-summary" class="muted">Find a candidate after entering the authoring world.</p></div>
        <p id="run-summary" class="muted">Studio is looking for the exact world, binding, participant, content, and run identity.</p>
        <label id="run-select-row" hidden>Exact run<select id="run-select"></select><small>World, binding, participant, and content are fixed by Runtime.</small></label>
        <div id="reset-preview" class="reset-preview" hidden></div>
        <div class="button-row"><button id="preview-reset" class="quiet" disabled>Preview clean rerun</button><button id="confirm-reset" class="gold" hidden>Confirm clean rerun</button></div>
        <p class="proof-line">Reset keeps rewards already received. The successor run gets fresh action claims, so its rewards may be granted again.</p>
      </section>
    </section>

    <dialog id="event-picker" class="event-picker" aria-labelledby="event-picker-title">
      <div class="picker-head"><div><h2 id="event-picker-title">Browse player actions</h2><p>Search 34 creator-safe meanings, not the 91 low-level game seams behind them.</p></div><span id="event-result-count" class="picker-count" aria-live="polite"></span><button id="event-picker-close" class="icon plain" aria-label="Close action browser">&times;</button></div>
      <div class="picker-toolbar"><label class="picker-search"><span class="sr-only">Search player actions</span><input id="event-search" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Search 34 actions&hellip;"></label><div id="event-categories" class="event-categories" role="toolbar" aria-label="Filter by rune school"></div><label class="extended-toggle"><input id="include-extended" type="checkbox"> Include Extended</label></div>
      <div class="picker-body"><div id="event-results" class="event-results" role="list" aria-label="Player actions"></div><aside id="event-preview" class="event-preview" aria-live="polite"><span class="eyebrow">Action details</span><h3>Choose an action</h3><p>Production actions can become quest beats. Research actions stay visible so the boundary is explicit.</p></aside></div>
    </dialog>

    <section id="advanced-tools" class="advanced-workspace" hidden>
      <header class="stage-hero advanced-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Advanced tools</span><h2>Inspect and shape Runtime details</h2><p>Changes here remain compatible with the creator workflow whenever the graph stays linear.</p></div><button id="back-to-beats" class="quiet">Back to creator workflow</button></header>
      <nav class="tool-switcher" aria-label="Advanced tools"><button data-tool-tab="graph" class="active">Graph editor</button><button data-tool-tab="json">Certified JSON</button><button data-tool-tab="data">Data &amp; history</button></nav>
      <section id="tool-graph" class="tool-panel graph-tool" hidden>
        <section id="advanced-builder" class="canvas-panel panel">
          <div class="panel-head canvas-toolbar"><div><span class="eyebrow">Guided graph</span><h2>Quest flow</h2></div><div class="toolbar-actions"><button id="add-next">Add next</button><button id="add-branch" class="quiet">Add branch</button><button id="fit-canvas" class="quiet">Fit selected</button></div></div>
          <div id="canvas-viewport"><div id="canvas-world"><svg id="edges"></svg><div id="nodes"></div></div></div><div class="canvas-help">Drag nodes to arrange them. Select a node to edit its routes and effects.</div>
          <section class="advanced-runtime-evidence" aria-label="Live Runtime evidence"><div class="advanced-runtime-head"><span>Active in game</span><strong id="advanced-active-revision" class="active-revision-value">Nothing active.</strong></div><div id="advanced-runtime-receipts" class="receipt-list compact"><div class="empty">No matching live receipts yet.</div></div></section>
        </section>
        <div id="graph-resizer" class="graph-resizer" role="separator" aria-label="Resize graph inspector" aria-orientation="vertical" aria-controls="advanced-builder graph-inspector" aria-valuemin="320" aria-valuemax="720" aria-valuenow="420" tabindex="0" title="Drag to resize; double-click to reset"></div>
        <aside id="graph-inspector" class="graph-inspector panel"><div id="node-empty" class="empty">Select a node on the canvas.</div><div id="node-editor" hidden><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Selected node</span><h2 id="node-title">Node</h2></div><button id="make-entry" class="quiet">Make start</button></div><div class="form-grid"><label>Node ID<input id="node-id" maxlength="64"></label><label>Label<input id="node-label" maxlength="120"></label></div><div class="route-bar"><label>Route<select id="route-select"></select></label><button id="add-route" class="quiet">Add route</button><button id="remove-route" class="danger">Remove</button></div><div id="route-editor"><div class="form-grid"><label>Route ID<input id="route-id" maxlength="64"></label><label>Priority<input id="route-priority" type="number" min="-10000" max="10000"></label></div><label>When this happens<select id="route-event"></select></label><div class="form-grid"><label id="route-target-row">Target<input id="route-target" maxlength="120" placeholder="Optional exact target"></label><label id="route-role-row">Actor<select id="route-role"></select></label></div><div id="route-where-fields" class="specific-fields"></div><label id="timer-trigger-row" hidden>Timer ID<input id="route-timer" maxlength="64"></label><section class="adaptive-editor"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Extended</span><h3>Adaptive conditions</h3></div><button id="add-adaptive-condition" class="quiet">Add condition</button></div><p class="muted">Require a persisted Runtime fact as well as the player action. These conditions stay out of the beginner palette.</p><div id="adaptive-condition-list"></div></section><section class="adaptive-editor spatial-editor"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Extended</span><h3>Spatial conditions</h3></div><button id="add-spatial-condition" class="quiet">Add condition</button></div><p class="muted">Compose the player action with an observed position. These conditions stay out of the beginner palette.</p><div id="spatial-condition-list"></div></section><div class="form-grid"><label>Then<select id="route-destination"></select></label><label>Terminal outcome<select id="route-outcome"><option value="">Continue</option><option value="complete">Complete</option><option value="fail">Fail</option></select></label></div><div class="section-title actions-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Effects</span><h3>Actions</h3></div><div class="inline"><select id="new-action-type"></select><button id="add-action" class="quiet">Add</button></div></div><div id="action-list"></div></div></div></aside>
      </section>
      <section id="tool-json" class="tool-panel panel json-tool" hidden><div><span class="eyebrow">Certified artifact</span><h2>Compiled Runtime JSON</h2><p class="muted">Validate without storing a certificate, or certify the exact immutable document.</p><div class="button-row"><button id="certify-project">Certify</button><button id="copy-json" class="quiet">Copy JSON</button><button id="download-json" class="quiet">Download</button></div></div><pre id="json-output">Certify to inspect the exact Runtime document.</pre></section>
      <section id="tool-data" class="tool-panel data-tool" hidden>
        <section class="panel identity-card"><div class="identity-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Runtime identity</span><h2>Package compatibility</h2><p class="muted">Studio generates and preserves these values. Change them only before first publish or when matching an existing package.</p></div><details class="identity-details"><summary>Edit Runtime identity</summary><div class="advanced-meta"><label>Pack ID<input id="pack-id" maxlength="64"></label><label>Experience ID<input id="experience-id" maxlength="64"></label><label>Charm surface override<select id="binding"><option value="">Use all reviewed surfaces</option><option value="sign">Sign only</option><option value="player_built_piece">Player-built piece only</option><option value="item_stand">Item stand only</option><option value="dedicated_charm">Dedicated charm only</option></select></label></div><p class="identity-note">Leave the surface override unset for current projects. The single-surface choices preserve compatibility with older Charm packages.</p></details></section>
        <section class="panel data-card"><div><span class="eyebrow">Lossless extract</span><h2>Take the project with you</h2><p class="muted">Exports stay out of the everyday path. The project bundle preserves draft and history bytes with a hash manifest.</p></div><div class="extract-options"><label class="check-label"><input id="include-live-evidence" type="checkbox"> Include matching local Runtime evidence</label><p id="live-evidence-warning" class="privacy-warning" hidden>This can include local player, world, or receipt identity. Review the bundle before sharing it.</p><div class="button-row"><button id="download-bundle">Download project bundle</button><button id="download-questpack" class="quiet">Download current questpack</button><button id="download-compiled" class="quiet">Download compiled JSON</button></div><p id="extract-status" class="muted" role="status"></p></div></section>
        <section class="panel history-card"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Certified history</span><h2>Immutable versions</h2></div><button id="refresh-history" class="quiet">Refresh</button></div><div id="history-list" class="history-list"><div class="empty">Choose a project to inspect its history.</div></div></section>
        <section class="panel usage-card"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Private by design</span><h2>Local usage insights</h2></div><label class="switch-label"><input id="usage-enabled" type="checkbox"> Enabled</label></div><p class="muted">Studio keeps only fixed-choice counters and broad numeric buckets on this machine. It records no titles, messages, targets, searches, identities, exact timestamps, or network uploads.</p><div id="usage-summary" class="usage-summary"><span>No local aggregate loaded.</span></div><div class="button-row"><button id="download-usage" class="quiet">Download aggregate JSON</button><button id="reset-usage" class="danger">Reset aggregate</button></div><p id="usage-status" class="muted" role="status"></p></section>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
<script src="/quest-studio/studio.js"></script></body></html>
""";

    public const string Css = """
/* Quest Studio — creator-loop design language (docs/design/creator-loop-tokens.md).
   Fonts are local-first stacks: the design faces lead but nothing loads over the network.
   --dim is #7d87a0, not the design's #6b7488, to hold the pinned 4.5:1 contrast matrix. */
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#050810;--panel:#0b1120;--panel-raised:#0e1526;--panel-warm:#1a140a;--line:#1d2a40;--line-mid:#2a3854;--line-strong:#35516e;--ink:#e9e4d8;--ink-soft:#b9c2d4;--muted:#9aa3b5;--dim:#7d87a0;--faint:#4e5870;--gold:#e9a83f;--gold-soft:#3a2c12;--green:#7ec482;--green-bg:#12291a;--red:#e08073;--red-bg:#2a1a18;--blue:#7fa8cc;--blue-bg:#16283c;--violet:#a15cff;--amber:#f4c061;--amber-bg:#33250f;--node:#0d1524;--inset:#080d18;--shadow:0 16px 40px #0005;--sans:'Source Sans 3',Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;--serif:Grenze,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;--mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,'Cascadia Mono',Consolas,monospace}
*{box-sizing:border-box}[hidden]{display:none!important}
html,body{height:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.5 var(--sans);overflow:hidden}
a{color:var(--blue)}a:hover{color:#a9c8e4}
::placeholder{color:var(--dim)}
button,input,select,textarea,summary{font:inherit;outline:none}
button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,[tabindex]:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #e9a83f66}
@keyframes savePulse{0%,100%{opacity:.5}50%{opacity:1}}
@keyframes riseIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
@keyframes drawerIn{from{transform:translateX(30px);opacity:0}to{transform:none;opacity:1}}
.sr-only{position:absolute!important;width:1px!important;height:1px!important;padding:0!important;margin:-1px!important;overflow:hidden!important;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)!important;white-space:nowrap!important;border:0!important}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px}
.eyebrow{display:block;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold)}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}
.mono-tag{font:10.5px var(--mono);font-style:normal;color:var(--dim);margin-left:6px}
.empty{color:var(--dim);padding:18px;text-align:center;border:1px dashed var(--line-mid);border-radius:12px}
.panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px}
button{min-height:36px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 14px;background:var(--gold-soft);border-color:#e9a83f55;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
button:hover{border-color:var(--gold)}
button.gold{background:var(--gold-soft);border:1px solid #e9a83f66;color:var(--gold)}
button.quiet,button.icon{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
button.quiet:hover,button.icon:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong);color:var(--ink)}
button.icon{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:34px;min-height:30px;height:30px;padding:0}
button.plain{background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:20px;line-height:1;width:30px}
button.plain:hover{color:var(--ink)}
button.danger{color:var(--red);border-color:var(--line-mid)}button.danger:hover{border-color:var(--red)}
button:disabled{opacity:.42;cursor:not-allowed}
label{display:block;margin:9px 0 4px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);background:var(--inset);color:var(--ink)}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:var(--gold)}
textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:64px}
label small,.specific-fields small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.readiness{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:26px;padding:3px 11px;border:1px solid var(--faint);border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);font:600 11px var(--mono);text-transform:lowercase;letter-spacing:.02em}
.readiness.good{border-color:#7ec48255;background:var(--green-bg);color:var(--green)}
.readiness.warn{border-color:#f4c06155;background:var(--amber-bg);color:var(--amber)}
.readiness.bad{border-color:#e0807355;background:var(--red-bg);color:var(--red)}
.button-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.push-right{margin-left:auto}

/* ---- App bar ---- */
.appbar{position:relative;z-index:100;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;height:70px;padding:10px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel-raised),var(--inset))}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:230px}
.library-toggle{flex:none;font-size:16px}
.brand-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e9a83f55;background:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold);font:700 15px var(--serif)}
.appbar h1{margin:0;font-size:16px}
.brand p{margin:0;font:10.5px var(--mono);color:var(--dim)}
.journey{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin:0 auto}
.stage-sep{color:var(--faint);padding:0 2px}
.stage-button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-height:44px;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;text-align:left}
.stage-button:hover{color:var(--ink);border:none}
.stage-button.active{background:var(--panel-raised);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--gold)}
.stage-number{display:grid;place-items:center;width:19px;height:19px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--faint);color:var(--dim);font:11px var(--mono)}
.stage-button.active .stage-number{background:var(--gold-soft);border-color:#e9a83f88;color:var(--gold)}
.stage-button.done .stage-number{background:var(--green-bg);border-color:#7ec48266;color:var(--green)}
.stage-copy strong,.stage-copy small{display:block;line-height:1.25}
.stage-copy small{color:var(--dim);font-size:10px;font-weight:400;max-width:120px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.app-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:16px;min-width:230px}
.save-state{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.save-state strong{font-weight:400}
#save-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--green)}
.save-state.dirty #save-dot{background:var(--gold);animation:savePulse .9s infinite}
.save-state.bad #save-dot{background:var(--red)}
#revision{font:11px var(--mono);color:var(--dim)}

/* ---- Advanced tools drawer ---- */
.tools-menu>summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:32px;padding:6px 14px;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}
.tools-menu>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tools-menu>summary:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong);color:var(--ink)}
.tools-menu[open]>summary{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
.tools-scrim{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:60;background:#000a}
.tools-popover{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:61;width:370px;padding:24px;overflow:auto;background:var(--panel-raised);border-left:1px solid var(--line-mid);animation:drawerIn .2s ease-out}
.tools-head{display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px}
.tools-head h2{margin:0;font-size:19px}
.tools-head .plain{margin-left:auto}
.tools-note{color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px;margin:0 0 20px}
.tool-card{display:block;width:100%;margin-bottom:12px;padding:16px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;color:var(--ink);text-align:left;font-weight:400;min-height:0}
.tool-card:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong)}
.tool-card strong,.tool-card span{display:block}
.tool-card strong{margin-bottom:3px;font-weight:600}
.tool-card span{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px}
.tools-privacy{margin:8px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.6}

/* ---- Shell, library, toast ---- */
.shell{position:relative;height:calc(100vh - 70px)}
.workspace{height:100%;overflow:auto;padding:30px 28px 80px}
.journey-stage,.advanced-workspace{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;animation:riseIn .18s ease-out}
.library{position:fixed;z-index:70;top:80px;bottom:10px;left:12px;width:min(430px,calc(100vw - 24px));display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 70px #000b;transform:translateX(calc(-100% - 24px));transition:transform .18s ease;background:var(--panel-raised)}
.library.open{transform:translateX(0)}
.panel-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}
.panel-head h2{margin:2px 0 0;font-size:21px}
.library-head-actions{display:flex;gap:5px}
.library-head-actions .icon{width:auto;padding:0 10px;font-size:12px}
.library-search{display:block;margin-top:12px}.library-search input{width:100%}
.portfolio-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:8px}.portfolio-actions button{flex:1 1 30%}
.portfolio-settings,.guild-editor{margin-top:9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:var(--inset)}
.portfolio-settings>summary,.guild-editor>summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:9px 10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.portfolio-settings>summary::-webkit-details-marker,.guild-editor>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.portfolio-settings>summary:before,.guild-editor>summary:before{content:'+ ';color:var(--gold)}.portfolio-settings[open]>summary:before,.guild-editor[open]>summary:before{content:'- '}
.portfolio-settings>div,.guild-editor-body{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:0 10px 10px}.guild-editor-body{max-height:calc(100vh - 230px);overflow:auto}.portfolio-settings label,.guild-editor label{display:grid;gap:4px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.portfolio-settings input,.guild-editor input,.guild-editor textarea,.guild-editor select{width:100%}.guild-editor textarea{resize:vertical}.guild-inline,.guild-command-row,.guild-add-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}.guild-inline>button{align-self:end}.guild-add-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto}.guild-command-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.project-list{flex:1;overflow:auto;margin:14px -5px;min-height:120px}
.guild-group{margin:4px 0 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--inset)}
.guild-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:100%;min-height:0;padding:9px 10px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink);text-align:left}
.guild-group.selected .guild-head{box-shadow:inset 3px 0 var(--gold);background:var(--hover)}
.guild-head strong{flex:1}.guild-head span{font-size:10px;color:var(--dim)}
.guild-body{padding:3px 5px 6px}.guild-section{margin:5px 5px 2px;color:var(--faint);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
.guild-group.archived{opacity:.66}.project-button .artifact-kind{display:inline-block;margin:0 5px 0 0;color:var(--gold);font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase}
.guild-prerequisites{display:grid;gap:7px}.guild-prerequisite-row{padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}.guild-prerequisite-row strong,.guild-prerequisite-row small{display:block}.guild-prerequisite-row small{color:var(--dim);margin:2px 0 5px}.guild-prerequisite-row select{min-height:54px}
.guild-lenses{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:4px;padding:3px;background:var(--panel-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px}.guild-lenses button{min-height:30px;padding:5px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.guild-lenses button[aria-selected=true]{background:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold)}
.guild-lens-panel{display:grid;gap:9px}.guild-lens-intro{margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.45}.guild-work-card{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:var(--panel)}.guild-card-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}.guild-card-head strong{font:700 14px var(--serif)}.compact-copy{margin:0;font-size:10.5px}.guild-current-project{padding:7px 8px;border:1px dashed var(--line-mid);border-radius:7px;color:var(--ink-soft);font:10.5px var(--mono);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.guild-ledger-list{display:grid;gap:7px}.guild-ledger-card{padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--inset)}.guild-ledger-card header{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}.guild-ledger-card header strong{font-size:11.5px}.guild-ledger-card header span{color:var(--gold);font:10px var(--mono)}.guild-ledger-card p{margin:4px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:10.5px}.guild-ledger-card code,.exact-value{display:block;color:var(--ink-soft);font:9.5px/1.45 var(--mono);overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal}.signature-targets{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}.target-token-row{display:grid;gap:6px;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--inset)}.target-token-row>strong{color:var(--gold);font-size:10px}.guild-compatibility{border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px}.guild-compatibility>summary{padding:8px;color:var(--dim);font-size:10.5px;cursor:pointer}.guild-compatibility>div{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:0 8px 8px}.campaign-placement{display:grid;gap:7px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line)}
.campaign-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-top:6px}.campaign-actions button{min-height:26px;padding:4px 7px;font-size:10px}.evidence-disclaimer{margin:0;padding:8px;border:1px solid #f4c06155;border-radius:8px;background:var(--amber-bg);color:var(--amber);font-size:10.5px}.guild-evidence{display:grid;gap:8px}.evidence-section{padding:9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:var(--panel)}.evidence-section h3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:14px}.evidence-section h4{margin:9px 0 4px;color:var(--gold);font-size:11px}.evidence-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);gap:3px 8px;margin:0}.evidence-grid dt{color:var(--dim);font-size:9.5px}.evidence-grid dd{margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft);font:9.5px/1.45 var(--mono);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.evidence-absent{color:var(--amber);font-size:10.5px}.evidence-present{color:var(--green);font-size:10.5px}
.unfiled-group{margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line)}
.project-button{display:block;width:100%;min-height:0;margin:2px 0;padding:11px;background:none;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:10px;color:var(--ink);text-align:left;font-weight:400}
.project-button:hover{background:var(--panel-raised);border-color:transparent}
.project-button.active{background:var(--panel-warm);border-color:#e9a83f44}
.project-button strong,.project-button span{display:block}
.project-button span{color:var(--dim);font-size:12px;margin-top:3px}
.new-project{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:10px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.new-project label{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
.library-actions{margin-top:12px}
.library-actions>summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:8px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
.library-actions>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.library-actions>summary:before{content:'+ ';color:var(--gold)}
.library-actions[open]>summary:before{content:'- '}
.library-actions>div{display:grid;gap:7px}
.library-actions label{display:grid;gap:4px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
.library-hint{margin:14px 0 0;color:var(--dim);font-size:11px}
.library-scrim{position:fixed;z-index:65;inset:70px 0 0;display:block;visibility:hidden;opacity:0;width:100%;padding:0;border:none;border-radius:0;background:#03060899;transition:opacity .18s,visibility .18s;min-height:0}
.library-scrim.open{visibility:visible;opacity:1}
.activity-message{position:fixed;z-index:90;right:18px;bottom:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:min(430px,calc(100vw - 36px));min-height:46px;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:12px;background:#0e1526f2;color:var(--muted);box-shadow:var(--shadow);transform:translateY(18px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .16s,transform .16s}
.activity-message.showing,.activity-message.bad{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.activity-message.bad{border-color:#e0807355;background:#1d1413f2}
.activity-message.good{border-color:#7ec48244}
.activity-rune{color:var(--gold);font-size:12px}
.activity-message.bad .activity-rune{color:var(--red)}
.activity-message.good .activity-rune{color:var(--green)}
.activity-message strong,.activity-message span{display:block}
.activity-message strong{color:var(--ink);font-size:12px}
.activity-message span{font-size:11px}
.status-dismiss{margin-left:auto;width:28px;min-height:28px;padding:0;background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted)}
.stage-hero{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;margin-bottom:26px}
.stage-hero h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:25px}
.stage-hero p{margin:0;max-width:600px;color:var(--muted)}
.stage-hero.narrow{max-width:760px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}

/* ---- Author ---- */
.author-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 300px;gap:36px;align-items:start}
.author-eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:2px}
.title-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;margin-bottom:6px}
#title{flex:1;background:none;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;border-radius:0;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;font-size:25px;color:var(--ink);padding:4px 0}
#title:focus{border-bottom-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:none}
#version{width:74px;background:none;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;border-radius:0;font:13px var(--mono);color:var(--dim);text-align:right;padding:4px 0}
#version:focus{border-bottom-color:var(--gold);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:none}
.beat-count{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:22px}
.advanced-note{margin-bottom:14px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid #f4c06144;border-radius:13px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:13px}
.advanced-note strong{color:var(--ink)}
.advanced-note button{margin-left:10px;min-height:30px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px}
.beat-ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative}
.beat-item{position:relative;padding-left:44px}
.beat-item:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:13px;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:var(--line)}
.beat-num{position:absolute;left:0;top:18px;z-index:1;display:grid;place-items:center;width:27px;height:27px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line-mid);color:var(--dim);font:12px var(--mono)}
.beat-num.sel{background:var(--gold-soft);border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
.beat-card{margin-bottom:10px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
.beat-card:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong)}
.beat-card.selected{background:var(--panel-raised);border-color:#e9a83f66;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.beat-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:13px;cursor:pointer}
.beat-copy{flex:1;min-width:0}
.beat-school{display:block;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px}
.beat-name{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;font-size:17.5px}
.beat-chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end}
.chip{display:inline-block;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px;font:11.5px var(--mono)}
.chip-repeat{color:var(--gold);background:var(--gold-soft);border:1px solid #e9a83f33}
.chip-window{color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue-bg);border:1px solid #7fa8cc33}
.chip-message{color:var(--muted);background:var(--panel-raised);border:1px solid var(--line-mid);font:italic 11.5px var(--sans);max-width:180px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.empty-beats{border:1px dashed var(--line-mid);border-radius:14px;padding:44px 32px;text-align:center}
.empty-beats strong{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;margin-bottom:6px}
.empty-beats span{display:block;color:var(--muted);max-width:380px;margin:0 auto}
.beat-palette{padding-left:44px;margin-top:14px;display:grid;gap:8px}
.browse-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:100%;padding:13px 18px;background:var(--panel);border:1px dashed var(--line-strong);border-radius:13px;color:var(--gold);font-size:14px;text-align:left;min-height:0}
.browse-row:hover{border-color:var(--gold);background:var(--panel-raised)}
.browse-plus{display:grid;place-items:center;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #e9a83f66;font-size:14px;line-height:1}
.browse-label{font-weight:600}
.browse-count{color:var(--dim);font-size:12px;margin-left:auto;font-weight:400}
.add-wait{justify-self:start;min-height:30px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;border-style:dashed}
.author-aside{position:sticky;top:0}
.upnext{background:var(--panel-warm);border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.upnext h2,.upnext h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:17px}
.upnext p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:0 0 16px}
.upnext .eyebrow{margin-bottom:8px}
.spatial-handoff{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:14px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--panel)}.spatial-handoff h3{margin:0;font-size:16px}.spatial-handoff p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11.5px}.spatial-handoff label{margin:0;font-size:11px}.spatial-handoff input[type=file]{font-size:11px}
.aside-note{margin:14px 0 0;padding:0 6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.6}

/* ---- Inline beat editor ---- */
.beat-editor{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 18px;animation:riseIn .18s ease-out}
.beat-editor-row{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end}
.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;margin:0;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.field.grow{flex:1;min-width:200px}
.field input{height:30px;padding:0 10px;font-size:13px}
.stepper{display:flex;align-items:center}
.stepper button{width:28px;height:30px;min-height:30px;padding:0;background:var(--inset);border:1px solid var(--line-mid);color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.stepper button:hover{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--line-mid)}
#beat-repeat-dec{border-right:none;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px}
#beat-repeat-inc{border-left:none;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}
.stepper input{width:52px;height:30px;border-radius:0;text-align:center;font:13px var(--mono)}
.stepper em,.suffix-field em{font-style:normal;font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);margin-left:8px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:400}
.suffix-field{display:flex;align-items:center}
.suffix-field input{width:90px;font:13px var(--mono)}
#beat-message{font-style:italic}
.beat-tools{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-left:auto}
.beat-tools .icon{width:30px}
.beat-more{margin-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding-top:10px}
.beat-more>summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--dim);font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
.beat-more>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.beat-more>summary:before{content:'+ ';color:var(--gold)}
.beat-more[open]>summary:before{content:'- '}
.beat-more>summary:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.inspector-section{padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.beat-more-body .inspector-section:first-child{border-top:none}
.inspector-section h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:13px;font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600}
.inspector-section label{font-size:12px}
.section-title{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}
.instruction{margin:9px 0;padding:8px 10px;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);background:var(--panel-warm);color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:12px}
.specific-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}
.specific-fields label{min-width:0}
.adaptive-editor{margin:16px 0;padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--inset)}
.adaptive-editor .section-title{margin-bottom:4px}.adaptive-editor h3{margin:0}.adaptive-editor>p{margin:0 0 10px}
.adaptive-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 92px auto auto;gap:7px;align-items:end;margin-top:8px}.adaptive-row .adaptive-value{min-width:0}.adaptive-row .adaptive-unit{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;padding-bottom:10px}.adaptive-row .remove-adaptive{margin-bottom:0}
.spatial-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(110px,1fr));padding:9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:var(--inset)}.spatial-row .spatial-coordinates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px;grid-column:1/-1}.spatial-row .spatial-source{grid-column:1/-1;color:var(--green);font:10px/1.5 var(--mono);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.spatial-row .remove-spatial{justify-self:end}
.specific-details summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;font-size:12px}
.check-label,.switch-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:9px 0 4px}
.check-label input,.switch-label input,.extended-toggle input{width:auto;accent-color:var(--gold)}
.compact-button{min-height:30px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:8px}
.effect-adder{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:7px;align-items:end;margin-top:9px}
.effect-adder label{margin:0}
.beat-effect-list{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:8px}
.beat-effect{padding:9px;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:8px;background:var(--inset)}
.beat-effect-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}
.beat-effect-head strong{color:var(--gold)}
.beat-effect-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}
.beat-effect-fields .wide{grid-column:1/-1}
.beat-effect .danger{min-height:26px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:11px}
.reward-card{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #e9a83f33;border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel-warm)}
.reward-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 110px;gap:8px}

/* ---- Rehearse ---- */
.rehearse-column{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}
.rehearse-card{padding:24px;animation:riseIn .18s ease-out}
.rehearse-card-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:6px}
.rehearse-card-head h3{margin:2px 0 0;font-size:17px}
.guided-actions{margin:17px 0 0}
.manual-rehearsal{margin-top:20px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.manual-rehearsal>summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px}
.manual-rehearsal>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.manual-rehearsal>summary:before{content:'+ ';color:var(--gold)}
.manual-rehearsal[open]>summary:before{content:'- '}
.manual-rehearsal h3{margin:14px 0 4px;font-size:13px;font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600}
.event-tray{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:8px 0 12px}
.event-chip{min-height:30px;padding:4px 11px;font-size:12px;background:var(--blue-bg);border:1px solid #7fa8cc33;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}
.event-chip:hover{border-color:var(--blue)}
.manual-event{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px;margin-top:10px}
.manual-event button,.manual-event select,.manual-event input{min-width:0}
.advance{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:6px;margin:8px 0 4px}
.wide-button{width:100%;margin-top:7px}
.path-note{margin:12px 0;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #f4c06144;border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:12.5px}
.path-note strong{display:block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--amber);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.path-note small{display:block;color:var(--dim);margin-top:8px}
.limit-row{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:4px 0}
.limit-row span:first-child{color:var(--amber)}
.result-card{margin-top:16px;padding:0;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;animation:riseIn .2s ease-out}
.result-card.empty{padding:36px;border-style:dashed;background:none;text-align:center;color:var(--dim)}
.result-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.good-ink{color:var(--green);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}
.bad-ink{color:var(--red);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}
.result-meta{color:var(--dim);font:12px var(--mono);margin-left:auto}
.trace-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:11px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.trace-mark{width:14px;flex:none;color:var(--dim)}
.trace-row.matched .trace-mark{color:var(--green)}
.trace-name{width:190px;flex:none;font-weight:600;font-size:13px}
.trace-detail{flex:1;font:12px var(--mono);color:var(--muted)}
.trace-ok{font:11px var(--mono);color:var(--green)}
.receipt-why{display:block;color:var(--dim);font-size:11px}
.trace-beat{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.trace-beat .trace-row{border-bottom:none}
.trace-row.beat .trace-name{font-weight:600}
.trace-row.attempt{padding:6px 20px 6px 46px;background:var(--inset)}
.trace-row.attempt .trace-name{font-weight:500;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.trace-row.partial .trace-mark,.trace-ok.partial{color:var(--amber)}
.trace-row.done .trace-mark,.trace-ok.done{color:var(--green)}
.trace-row.idle .trace-mark,.trace-ok.idle{color:var(--dim)}
.result-card .path-note{margin:16px 20px;border-color:#f4c06144}
.result-card .disclaimer{margin:16px 20px;color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px;font-style:italic}
.proof-line{max-width:760px;margin:16px auto 0;color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px;font-style:italic}

/* ---- Publish ---- */
.readiness-summary{display:flex;gap:14px;flex:none}
.readiness-summary span{display:grid;gap:2px;color:var(--dim);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:600}
.readiness-summary strong{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:11.5px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0}
.stage-hero .readiness-summary{margin-top:6px}
.diagnostic-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 26px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #e0807355;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 24px;animation:riseIn .2s ease-out}
.diag-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.diag-title{color:var(--red);font:700 17px var(--serif)}
.diag-code{font:11.5px var(--mono);color:var(--red);background:var(--red-bg);border:1px solid #e0807333;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px}
.diag-message{color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 6px;max-width:560px}
.diag-foot{color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px;margin:0 0 16px}
.publish-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:28px;align-items:start;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto}
.checklist-panel{overflow:hidden}
.checklist-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.publish-checklist{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.publish-checklist li{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);opacity:.55}
.publish-checklist li:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.publish-checklist li.done,.publish-checklist li.current{opacity:1}
.publish-checklist li.current{background:var(--panel-warm);box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--gold)}
.step-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:22px;height:22px;flex:none;margin-top:1px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--faint);color:var(--dim);font:11px var(--mono)}
.step-icon:before{content:attr(data-n)}
li.done .step-icon{background:var(--green-bg);border-color:#7ec48266;color:var(--green)}
li.done .step-icon:before{content:'\2713'}
li.current .step-icon{background:var(--gold-soft);border-color:#e9a83f88;color:var(--gold)}
.step-copy{flex:1;min-width:0}
.step-copy strong{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted)}
li.done .step-copy strong,li.current .step-copy strong{color:var(--ink)}
.step-copy span{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--dim)}
.upnext.big{border-color:#e9a83f44;padding:24px}
.upnext-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px}
.upnext-title h3{margin:0;font-size:21px}
.keycaps{display:inline-flex;gap:6px}
.key{font:13px var(--mono);background:var(--inset);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:7px;padding:2px 10px;color:var(--ink)}
.upnext.big .muted{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 10px}
.active-revision-line{display:grid;gap:3px;margin:12px 0 14px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:9px;background:var(--inset)}
.active-revision-line>span,.advanced-runtime-head>span{color:var(--dim);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase}
.active-revision-value{color:var(--ink-soft);font:12px var(--mono)}
.active-revision-value.matches{color:var(--green)}
.active-revision-value.differs{color:var(--amber)}
.next-step{margin:0 0 16px;padding:10px 12px;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:13.5px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}
.publish-actions{display:flex;gap:8px}
.immutability-note{margin:14px 0 0;color:var(--dim);font-size:11px}
.receipts-panel{margin-top:16px;overflow:hidden}
.spatial-evidence-panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:24px;max-width:760px;margin:18px auto 0;padding:18px}.spatial-evidence-panel h2{margin:2px 0 5px;font-size:20px}.spatial-evidence-panel p{margin:0;max-width:520px}.spatial-evidence-panel>div:last-child{text-align:right}.spatial-evidence-panel>div:last-child p{margin-top:6px;font-size:11px}
.receipts-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.receipts-head small{color:var(--dim);font-size:11px}
.receipt-list{max-height:250px;overflow:auto}
.receipt-list .empty{border:none;padding:20px 18px;text-align:left;font-size:12.5px}
.receipt-row{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:8px 18px;font:12px var(--mono);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.receipt-row[data-live-node]{cursor:default}
.receipt-row[data-live-node]:hover,.receipt-row[data-live-node]:focus-visible{background:var(--green-bg);box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--green)}
.pass-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 52px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:center}
.pass-line strong{font:12px var(--mono);color:var(--ink)}
.pass-state{font:700 11px var(--mono);color:var(--green)}
.pass-line.fail .pass-state{color:var(--red)}
.pass-line span:last-child{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.receipt-time{color:var(--dim);flex:none}
.receipt-kind{color:var(--blue);width:72px;flex:none}
.receipt-text{color:var(--muted);min-width:0}
.receipt-mark{width:12px;flex:none;text-align:center;color:var(--faint);font-size:11px}
.receipt-row.kind-story .receipt-text{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.receipt-row.kind-story .receipt-mark{color:var(--gold)}
.receipt-row.kind-cast{background:#a15cff1a}
.receipt-row.kind-cast .receipt-text{color:#cfa9ff;font-weight:600}
.receipt-row.kind-cast .receipt-mark{color:var(--violet)}
.receipt-row.kind-warning .receipt-text{color:var(--amber)}
.receipt-row.kind-warning .receipt-mark{color:var(--amber)}
.receipt-row.kind-plumbing .receipt-text{color:var(--dim);font-size:11.5px}
.status-card{margin:0 0 10px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:var(--panel-raised)}
.status-title-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}
.status-title-row h3{margin:0;font-size:22px;color:var(--ink)}
.status-version{font:600 11.5px var(--mono);color:var(--ink-soft);background:var(--inset);border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 7px}
.status-state{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.status-state::before{content:'';width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--faint)}
.status-state.playing{color:var(--green)}.status-state.playing::before{background:var(--green)}
.status-state.earlier{color:var(--amber)}.status-state.earlier::before{background:var(--amber)}
.status-state.idle{color:var(--dim)}

/* ---- Event picker ---- */
.event-picker{width:min(960px,94vw);height:min(640px,90vh);padding:0;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:16px;background:var(--panel-raised);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 16px 40px #0008;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;animation:riseIn .18s ease-out}
.event-picker:not([open]){display:none}
.event-picker::backdrop{background:#000b}
.picker-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);flex:none}
.picker-head h2{margin:0;font-size:19px}
.picker-head p{margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--dim);font-size:12px}
.picker-head .plain{margin-left:auto;font-size:22px}
.picker-count{font:12px var(--mono);color:var(--dim);white-space:nowrap;margin-left:auto}
.picker-head .picker-count+ .plain{margin-left:16px}
.picker-toolbar{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:12px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);flex-wrap:wrap;flex:none}
.picker-search{flex:1;min-width:200px;margin:0}
.picker-search input{border-radius:999px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:13.5px}
.event-categories{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.event-categories button{min-height:28px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;text-transform:capitalize}
.event-categories button:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.event-categories button.active{background:var(--gold-soft);border-color:#e9a83f66;color:var(--gold)}
.extended-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}
.picker-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);flex:1;min-height:0}
.event-results{overflow:auto;border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px}
.event-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;margin-bottom:2px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:none;border:1px solid transparent;color:var(--ink);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;min-height:0;font-weight:400}
.event-row:hover{border-color:var(--line-mid)}
.event-row.selected{background:var(--panel-raised);border-color:#e9a83f66}
.event-row.research{opacity:.78}
.event-row.research.selected{opacity:1;background:var(--amber-bg);border-color:#f4c06166}
.school-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:999px;flex:none;background:var(--school,#9aa3b5)}
.event-row.research .school-dot{background:none;border:1px dashed var(--amber)}
.event-row-name{flex:1;min-width:0;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.event-row.research .event-row-name{color:var(--ink-soft)}
.event-row-school{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);width:78px;flex:none;text-transform:capitalize}
.availability-badge{display:inline-block;flex:none;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600}
.availability-badge.production{color:var(--green);background:var(--green-bg);border:1px solid #7ec48233}
.availability-badge.research{color:var(--amber);background:var(--amber-bg);border:1px dashed #f4c06155}
.research-divider{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:14px 6px 8px}
.research-divider span:first-child,.research-divider span:last-child{height:1px;flex:1;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#f4c06155 0 6px,transparent 6px 12px)}
.research-divider span:nth-child(2){font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--amber);font-weight:600;text-align:center}
.event-preview{overflow:auto;padding:24px;background:var(--inset)}
.preview-school{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}
.event-preview h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px}
.preview-desc{color:var(--ink-soft);margin:16px 0 10px;font-size:13.5px;max-width:340px}
.preview-sig{display:inline-block;font:12px var(--mono);color:var(--dim);background:var(--inset);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;margin-bottom:16px}
.preview-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:86px 1fr;gap:6px;margin:0 0 18px;font-size:12px}
.preview-facts dt{color:var(--dim)}
.preview-facts dd{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
.research-note{border:1px dashed #f4c06155;background:#33250f66;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--amber);max-width:340px;margin-bottom:18px}
.research-note .synthetic-note{display:block;margin-top:8px;color:#c9a765;font-size:11.5px}
.event-preview-actions{display:grid;gap:7px;justify-items:start}
.event-preview-actions small{color:var(--dim)}
.preview-keys{margin-top:22px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dim)}

/* ---- Advanced workspace ---- */
.advanced-hero{margin-bottom:10px}
.tool-switcher{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:5px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--inset)}
.tool-switcher button{flex:none;background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.tool-switcher button.active{background:var(--panel-warm);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--gold)}
.tool-panel{min-height:560px;padding:22px}
.advanced-workspace.graph-active{max-width:none}
.advanced-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:22px;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}
.graph-tool{--graph-inspector-width:420px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(560px,1fr) 10px minmax(320px,var(--graph-inspector-width));gap:0;padding:0;background:none;border:none}
.graph-tool .canvas-panel,.graph-tool .graph-inspector{height:calc(100vh - 250px);min-height:560px}
.graph-resizer{position:relative;z-index:2;min-width:10px;cursor:col-resize;touch-action:none}
.graph-resizer:before{content:'';position:absolute;top:12px;bottom:12px;left:4px;width:2px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--line-mid);transition:background .12s,box-shadow .12s}
.graph-resizer:hover:before,.graph-resizer:focus-visible:before,.resizing-graph .graph-resizer:before{background:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #e9a83f22}
.resizing-graph{cursor:col-resize;user-select:none}
.canvas-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}
.canvas-toolbar{padding:12px 15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.canvas-toolbar h2{margin:2px 0;font-size:19px}
.toolbar-actions{display:flex;gap:7px}
#canvas-viewport{position:relative;flex:1;overflow:auto;background-color:var(--inset);background-image:linear-gradient(#1d2a4044 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#1d2a4044 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:28px 28px}
#canvas-world{position:relative;width:1500px;height:900px}
#edges{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible;pointer-events:none}
.edge{fill:none;stroke:#8a6420;stroke-width:2}
.edge.branch{stroke:var(--violet);stroke-dasharray:7 5}
.edge.conditional{stroke:var(--violet);stroke-dasharray:2 5;stroke-width:2.5}
.route-chip{margin-left:5px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:99px;font-size:10.5px;background:#2a1f40;color:#cfa9ff}
.route-chip.spatial{background:#16303a;color:#8fd0e0}
.edge-label{fill:#9aa3b5;font-size:11px}
.graph-node{position:absolute;width:220px;min-height:108px;background:var(--node);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 9px 22px #0006;user-select:none}
.graph-node.selected{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #e9a83f22,0 12px 24px #0006}
.graph-node.live{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #7ec48244,0 12px 24px #0006}
.node-head{padding:10px 11px 7px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);cursor:grab}
.node-head:active{cursor:grabbing}
.node-head strong{display:block;font-size:15px}
.node-id{color:var(--dim);font:11px var(--mono)}
.node-body{padding:8px 11px}
.node-route{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:4px 0;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:12px}
.event-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue)}
.node-outcome{display:inline-block;margin-top:5px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--green-bg);color:var(--green);font-size:11px}
.start-badge{position:absolute;top:-9px;right:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#191006;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:99px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}
.canvas-help{padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim);font-size:12px}
.advanced-runtime-evidence{border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--inset);flex:none}
.advanced-runtime-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.advanced-runtime-head .active-revision-value{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.receipt-list.compact{max-height:126px}
.receipt-list.compact .receipt-row{padding:6px 12px}
.receipt-list.compact .empty{padding:10px 12px}
.graph-inspector{min-height:0;padding:18px;overflow:auto}
.graph-inspector h2{font-size:19px;margin:2px 0}
.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
.route-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;gap:6px;align-items:end;margin:15px 0 10px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.route-bar label{margin:0}
.actions-title{margin-top:16px;padding-top:11px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.inline{display:flex;gap:5px}
.inline select{width:145px}
.action-card{padding:10px;margin:8px 0;background:var(--inset);border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:8px}
.action-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.action-head strong{color:var(--gold)}
.action-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}
.action-fields .wide{grid-column:1/-1}
.json-tool{display:grid;grid-template-columns:320px 1fr;gap:22px}
.json-tool h2{font-size:21px}
pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:auto;max-height:calc(100vh - 320px);margin:0;padding:12px;background:#04070f;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;font:12px var(--mono)}
.data-tool{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(0,.8fr);gap:10px;padding:0;background:none;border:none}
.identity-card{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,.75fr) minmax(500px,1.25fr);gap:24px;align-items:start;min-height:0;padding:20px}
.identity-card h2{margin:3px 0;font-size:21px}
.identity-copy p{max-width:540px;margin-bottom:0}
.identity-details{align-self:center}
.identity-details>summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600}
.identity-details[open]>summary{color:var(--gold)}
.identity-details .advanced-meta{margin-top:12px;padding:14px}
.identity-note{margin:10px 2px 0;color:var(--dim);font-size:11.5px}
.data-card,.history-card,.usage-card{min-height:0;padding:20px}
.data-card{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,.8fr) minmax(320px,1.2fr);gap:24px}
.data-card h2,.history-card h2,.usage-card h2{margin:3px 0;font-size:21px}
.extract-options{align-self:center}
.privacy-warning{padding:9px 11px;border-left:2px solid var(--red);background:var(--red-bg);color:#efb1a9;font-size:12px}
.history-list{max-height:330px;margin-top:12px;overflow:auto}
.history-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:8px;padding:10px 2px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.history-row strong,.history-row span{display:block}
.history-row span,.history-row code{color:var(--dim);font-size:11px}
.history-row code{font-family:var(--mono)}
.usage-summary{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin:15px 0}
.usage-stat{padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--inset)}
.usage-stat strong,.usage-stat span{display:block}
.usage-stat span{color:var(--dim);font-size:10px}
.proof-note{display:grid;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-left:2px solid var(--green);border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
.proof-note strong{color:var(--ink)}
.run-control-panel{max-width:760px;margin:18px auto 0;padding:18px}.run-control-panel h2{margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px}.binding-control{display:grid;gap:9px;margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:10px;background:var(--inset)}.binding-control strong,.binding-control small{display:block}.binding-control small{color:var(--dim)}.binding-control select{width:min(330px,100%)}.reset-preview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line-mid);border-radius:10px;background:var(--inset)}.reset-preview span{padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted)}.reset-preview strong{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-size:16px}
